    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/22640b792bccb379cc748958063b6ef6.avif?t=1749661458\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an enthralling journey through the intricate world of One Dash Star, a physics-based puzzle game that will challenge your dexterity and strategic thinking. In this captivating adventure, you'll guide a marble towards its celestial destination, navigating through a series of increasingly intricate levels filled with fixed and moving obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/62a7f2e4f60699990f9f1ee3c8743137.poster.avif?t=1749661458\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/62a7f2e4f60699990f9f1ee3c8743137.webm?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/62a7f2e4f60699990f9f1ee3c8743137.mp4?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/1e2d0bf6b7e61e9861cbfa19ed082e49.avif?t=1749661458\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of One Dash Star is deceptively simple yet undeniably engaging. With a simple click and drag motion of your mouse or a flick of the joystick, you'll trace a path for the marble, guiding it with precision and finesse. Your objective is clear: deliver the marble safely to its designated star. But achieving this goal won't be easy. As you progress through the game, you'll encounter a diverse array of obstacles that will test your focus, reflexes, and strategic thinking.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/17667cbc7f070b34a5516d3b4a9aef12.poster.avif?t=1749661458\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/17667cbc7f070b34a5516d3b4a9aef12.webm?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/17667cbc7f070b34a5516d3b4a9aef12.mp4?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/a2540acc963981ceb9131954efba837a.avif?t=1749661458\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive and Addictive Gameplay:</strong> Master the art of guiding the marble with simple yet precise mouse or controller movements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse and Challenging Levels:</strong> Each level presents a unique set of obstacles, demanding strategic thinking and quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Vivid and Vibrant Graphics:</strong> Immerse yourself in a captivating world adorned with colorful and engaging visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upbeat and Motivating Soundtrack:</strong> Experience an exhilarating soundtrack that complements the intense gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Suitable for All Ages:</strong> Enjoy a fun and challenging experience that appeals to players of all ages and skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/c0766a3b6eb525990ca2e64cf6b44682.poster.avif?t=1749661458\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/c0766a3b6eb525990ca2e64cf6b44682.webm?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/c0766a3b6eb525990ca2e64cf6b44682.mp4?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/22640b792bccb379cc748958063b6ef6.avif?t=1749661458\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an enthralling journey through the intricate world of One Dash Star, a physics-based puzzle game that will challenge your dexterity and strategic thinking. In this captivating adventure, you'll guide a marble towards its celestial destination, navigating through a series of increasingly intricate levels filled with fixed and moving obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/62a7f2e4f60699990f9f1ee3c8743137.poster.avif?t=1749661458\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/62a7f2e4f60699990f9f1ee3c8743137.webm?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/62a7f2e4f60699990f9f1ee3c8743137.mp4?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/1e2d0bf6b7e61e9861cbfa19ed082e49.avif?t=1749661458\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of One Dash Star is deceptively simple yet undeniably engaging. With a simple click and drag motion of your mouse or a flick of the joystick, you'll trace a path for the marble, guiding it with precision and finesse. Your objective is clear: deliver the marble safely to its designated star. But achieving this goal won't be easy. As you progress through the game, you'll encounter a diverse array of obstacles that will test your focus, reflexes, and strategic thinking.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/17667cbc7f070b34a5516d3b4a9aef12.poster.avif?t=1749661458\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/17667cbc7f070b34a5516d3b4a9aef12.webm?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/17667cbc7f070b34a5516d3b4a9aef12.mp4?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/a2540acc963981ceb9131954efba837a.avif?t=1749661458\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive and Addictive Gameplay:</strong> Master the art of guiding the marble with simple yet precise mouse or controller movements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse and Challenging Levels:</strong> Each level presents a unique set of obstacles, demanding strategic thinking and quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Vivid and Vibrant Graphics:</strong> Immerse yourself in a captivating world adorned with colorful and engaging visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upbeat and Motivating Soundtrack:</strong> Experience an exhilarating soundtrack that complements the intense gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Suitable for All Ages:</strong> Enjoy a fun and challenging experience that appeals to players of all ages and skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/c0766a3b6eb525990ca2e64cf6b44682.poster.avif?t=1749661458\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/c0766a3b6eb525990ca2e64cf6b44682.webm?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071150/extras/c0766a3b6eb525990ca2e64cf6b44682.mp4?t=1749661458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
